{"paragraphs":[{"text":"%md\n# About This Lab\n**Objective:** Become familiar with Spark complex types operations\n**File locations:**\n**Successful outcome:**\n**Before you begin:**\n**Related lessons:** Working with DataFrames\n\nCopyright © 2010–2021 Cloudera. All rights reserved.\nNot to be reproduced or shared without prior written consent from Cloudera.\n\n---","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:25:37-0800","config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/markdown","editorHide":true,"fontSize":9,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946859995_-1308981959","id":"20171105-200834_1116095891","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:20:59-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:25:37-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:25:37-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"focus":true,"$$hashKey":"object:1537"},{"text":"%md\n## Overview\n\nIn this module we consider the complex collection data types provided bySpark SQL: arrays, maps, and structs.\nWe show how to construct and transform columns with complex collection data types.\n\n\n## Complex Collection Data Types\n\n* Complex collection data types provide a way to renormalize the denormalized data that is common in the big-data world\n\n* The complex collection data types are defined in the `pyspark.sql.types` module:\n    * The *ArrayType* represents a variable-length collection of elements\n    * The *MapType* represents a variable-length collection of key-value pairs\n    * The *StructType* represents a fixed-length collection of named elements\n\n* Complex collection data types are obtained in several ways:\n    * Inherited from Hive/Impala tables\n    * Inferred from nested JSON files\n    * Generated by aggregate functions such as `collect_list` and `collect_set`\n    * Constructed manually","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:25:38-0800","config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/markdown","fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946859999_-525206114","id":"20210609-214236_1622006817","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:20:59-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:25:38-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:25:38-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1538"},{"text":"%md\n# Setup\n---","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:25:38-0800","config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/markdown","fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946860001_553114284","id":"20181114-164229_902436001","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:00-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:25:38-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:25:38-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1539"},{"title":"Read the raw data from HDFS","text":"%pyspark\n\nrides = spark.read.csv(\"/duocar/raw/rides/\", header=True, inferSchema=True)\ndrivers = spark.read.csv(\"/duocar/raw/drivers/\", header=True, inferSchema=True)\nriders = spark.read.csv(\"/duocar/raw/riders/\", header=True, inferSchema=True)\n","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:25:38-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"python","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/python","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946860003_-1148963791","id":"20210609-214604_1208392134","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:00-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:25:38-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:26:25-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1540"},{"text":"%md\n# Lesson\n---","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:26:25-0800","config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/markdown","fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946860005_1294053106","id":"20210609-150445_381117564","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:00-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:26:25-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:26:25-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1541"},{"text":"%md\n## Arrays","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:26:26-0800","config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/markdown","fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946860008_-218517224","id":"20210609-214808_2124581014","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:00-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:26:26-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:26:26-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1542"},{"title":"Use the array function to create an array from multiple columns","text":"%pyspark\n\nfrom pyspark.sql.functions import array\ndrivers_array = drivers \\\n  .withColumn(\"vehicle_array\", array(\"vehicle_make\", \"vehicle_model\")) \\\n  .select(\"vehicle_make\", \"vehicle_model\", \"vehicle_array\")\n  \ndrivers_array.printSchema()\ndrivers_array.show(5, False)  # With `false`, we disable the truncation of columns containing values longer than 20 characters.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:26:26-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"python","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/python","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946860009_-291357292","id":"20210609-214950_490436151","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:00-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:26:26-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:26:27-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1543"},{"title":"Use index notation to access elements of the array","text":"%pyspark\n\nfrom pyspark.sql.functions import col\ndrivers_array \\\n  .select(\"vehicle_array\", col(\"vehicle_array\")[0]) \\\n  .show(5, False)","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:26:27-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"python","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/python","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946860015_1395723596","id":"20210609-215139_462878767","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:00-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:26:27-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:26:28-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1544"},{"title":"Use the size function to get the length of the array","text":"%pyspark\n\nfrom pyspark.sql.functions import size\ndrivers_array \\\n  .select(\"vehicle_array\", size(\"vehicle_array\")) \\\n  .show(5, False)","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:26:28-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"python","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/python","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946860017_-1247509754","id":"20210609-215230_879633660","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:00-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:26:28-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:26:30-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1545"},{"title":"Use the sort_array function to sort the array","text":"%pyspark\n\nfrom pyspark.sql.functions import sort_array\ndrivers_array \\\n  .select(\"vehicle_array\", sort_array(\"vehicle_array\", asc=True)) \\\n  .show(5, False)","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:26:30-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"python","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/python","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946860019_617344297","id":"20210609-215326_1600236400","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:00-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:26:30-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:26:32-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1546"},{"title":"Use the `array_contains` function to search the array","text":"%pyspark\n\nfrom pyspark.sql.functions import array_contains\ndrivers_array \\\n  .select(\"vehicle_array\", array_contains(\"vehicle_array\", \"Subaru\")) \\\n  .show(5, False)\n","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:26:32-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"python","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/python","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946860021_-1615200869","id":"20210609-215508_1658632882","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:00-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:26:32-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:26:33-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1547"},{"title":"Use the `explode` and `posexplode` functions to explode the array","text":"%pyspark\n\nfrom pyspark.sql.functions import explode, posexplode\n\ndrivers_array \\\n  .select(\"vehicle_array\", explode(\"vehicle_array\")) \\\n  .show(5, False)\n  \n# posexplode adds a 'pos' column containing the position to the result.\ndrivers_array \\\n  .select(\"vehicle_array\", posexplode(\"vehicle_array\")) \\\n  .show(5, False)","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:26:33-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"python","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/python","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946860022_24332062","id":"20210609-215631_592611552","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:00-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:26:33-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:26:35-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1548"},{"title":"Note that you can pass multiple names to the `alias` method","text":"%pyspark\n\ndrivers_array \\\n  .select(\"vehicle_array\", posexplode(\"vehicle_array\").alias(\"position\", \"column\")) \\\n  .show(5, False)","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:26:35-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"python","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/python","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946860024_1818212820","id":"20210609-215708_1101979237","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:00-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:26:35-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:26:36-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1549"},{"text":"%md\n## Maps","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:26:36-0800","config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/markdown","fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946860025_720656781","id":"20210609-214825_941697596","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:00-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:26:36-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:26:36-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1550"},{"title":"Use the create_map function to create a map","text":"%pyspark\n\nfrom pyspark.sql.functions import lit, create_map\n\n# `lit` (short for \"literal\") allows map keys to be created from a constant or static value (the 'make' and 'model' keys).\ndrivers_map = drivers \\\n  .withColumn(\"vehicle_map\", create_map(lit(\"make\"), \"vehicle_make\", lit(\"model\"), \"vehicle_model\")) \\\n  .select(\"vehicle_make\", \"vehicle_model\", \"vehicle_map\")\ndrivers_map.printSchema()\ndrivers_map.show(5, False)","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:26:36-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"python","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/python","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946860026_412950831","id":"20210609-215809_1949067261","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:00-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:26:37-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:26:38-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1551"},{"title":"Use dot notation to access a value by key","text":"%pyspark\n\ndrivers_map.select(\"vehicle_map\", col(\"vehicle_map\").make).show(5, False)\n\n# We can assign an alias to the column using the value from the map.\nprint('Con alias:')\ndrivers_map.select(\"vehicle_map\", col(\"vehicle_map\").make.alias('make')).show(5, False)","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:26:38-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"python","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/python","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946860028_913469764","id":"20210609-215929_1972517761","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:00-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:26:38-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:26:39-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1552"},{"title":"Use the `size` function to get the length of the map","text":"%pyspark\n\ndrivers_map.select(\"vehicle_map\", size(\"vehicle_map\")).show(5, False)","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:26:39-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"python","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/python","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946860029_-1503330135","id":"20210609-220011_2145852577","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:00-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:26:39-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:26:40-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1553"},{"title":"Use the `explode` and `posexplode` functions to explode the map","text":"%pyspark\n\ndrivers_map.select(\"vehicle_map\", explode(\"vehicle_map\")).show(5, False)\ndrivers_map.select(\"vehicle_map\", posexplode(\"vehicle_map\")).show(5, False)","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:26:40-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"python","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/python","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946860030_112039898","id":"20210609-220050_526377266","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:00-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:26:40-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:26:42-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1554"},{"text":"%md\n## Structs","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:26:42-0800","config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/markdown","fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946860033_836193580","id":"20210609-214847_1367988366","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:00-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:26:43-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:26:43-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1555"},{"title":"Use the struct function to create a struct","text":"%pyspark\n\nfrom pyspark.sql.functions import struct\ndrivers_struct = drivers \\\n  .withColumn(\"vehicle_struct\", struct(col(\"vehicle_make\").alias(\"make\"), col(\"vehicle_model\").alias(\"model\"))) \\\n  .select(\"vehicle_make\", \"vehicle_model\", \"vehicle_struct\")\ndrivers_struct.printSchema()\ndrivers_struct.show(5, False)\ndrivers_struct.head(5)","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:26:43-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"python","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/python","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946860034_1675388238","id":"20210609-220250_300408590","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:00-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:26:43-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:26:45-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1556"},{"title":"Note","text":"%md\nThe struct is a `Row` object (embedded in a `Row` object).","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:26:45-0800","config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/markdown","fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946860036_-2088302568","id":"20210609-220428_2046707505","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:00-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:26:45-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:26:45-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1557"},{"title":"Use dot notation to access struct elements","text":"%pyspark\n\ndrivers_struct \\\n  .select(\"vehicle_struct\", col(\"vehicle_struct\").make) \\\n  .show(5, False)","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:26:45-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"python","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/python","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946860038_1705974009","id":"20210609-220408_1212114924","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:00-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:26:45-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:26:46-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1558"},{"title":"Use the `to_json` function to convert the struct to a JSON string","text":"%pyspark\n\nfrom pyspark.sql.functions import to_json\ndrivers_struct \\\n  .select(\"vehicle_struct\", to_json(\"vehicle_struct\")) \\\n  .show(5, False)","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:26:46-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"python","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/python","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946860040_-81736477","id":"20210609-220533_1798862611","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:00-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:26:47-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:26:48-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1559"},{"text":"%md\n# Lab\n---","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:26:48-0800","config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/markdown","fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946860043_2125974292","id":"20210609-150527_79851234","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:00-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:26:48-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:26:48-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1560"},{"title":"1 - Create an array called `home_array` that includes the driver's home latitude and longitude","text":"%pyspark\n\nfrom pyspark.sql.functions import array\n\ndrivers_array = drivers \\\n  .withColumn(\"home_array\", array(\"home_lat\", \"home_lon\"))\n\ndrivers_array \\\n  .select(\"home_lat\", \"home_lon\", \"home_array\") \\\n  .show(5, False)\n","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:26:48-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"python","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/python","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946860045_626508596","id":"20210609-221114_987659308","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:00-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:26:48-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:26:49-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1561"},{"title":"2 - Create a map called `name_map` that includes the driver's first and last name","text":"%pyspark\n\n\nfrom pyspark.sql.functions import lit, create_map\n\ndrivers_map = drivers \\\n  .withColumn(\"name_map\", create_map(lit(\"first\"), \"first_name\", lit(\"last\"), \"last_name\"))\n  \ndrivers_map \\\n  .select(\"first_name\", \"last_name\", \"name_map\") \\\n  .show(5, False)","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:26:49-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"python","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/python","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1794946860046_-355507607","id":"20210609-221146_1508826613","dateCreated":"2026-11-17T12:21:00-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-17T12:26:49-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-17T12:26:50-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1562"},{"title":"3 - Create a struct called `name_struct` that includes the driver's first # and last name","text":"%pyspark\n\nfrom pyspark.sql.functions import col, struct\ndrivers_struct = drivers \\\n  .withColumn(\"name_struct\", struct(col(\"first_name\").alias(\"first\"), col(\"last_name\").alias(\"last\")))\n\nfrom pyspark.sql.functions import to_json\ndrivers_struct \\\n  .select(\"first_name\", \"last_name\", \"name_struct\", to_json(\"name_struct\")) \\\n  .show(5, False)","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-17T12:26:50-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"python","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/python","fontSize":9,"title